DESCRIPTION:Replace with an easy 60–70 min continuous run at 6:30–7:00/
 km (HR ≤138 bpm)\; stop immediately if cardiac drift appears. No distanc
 e target.\n\nReason: After three weeks of near-zero training and self-repo
 rted illness (15 Aug)\, a 180-min long run carries significant injury and 
 overreach risk — a short easy run re-establishes the habit without stres
 sing an under-recovered system.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-22
